# Scene-split / fusion lineage (Principle 9: co-equal, no taxonomy).
gmeow:genreMathRock        gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreRock .
gmeow:genreProgressiveRock gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreRock .
gmeow:genrePostRock        gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreRock .
gmeow:genreFusion          gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreJazz ;
                            gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreRock .
gmeow:genreDisco           gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreFunk ;
                            gmeow:wasDerivedFrom gmeow:genreSoul .

